---

This project is a MoonBit port of the Python `num2words` library
(https://github.com/savoirfairelinux/num2words), which is distributed under
the MIT License. The algorithmic approach, language coverage and many of the
spelling rules are derived from that upstream project; the implementation
itself is written from scratch in MoonBit.
